# Authentication and Authorization

## Strategy

JWT with **access token** + **refresh token**.

## Access token

- API authorization via `Authorization: Bearer <token>`
- Expires in 1 day (see `app/core/config`)
- Payload: `sub`, `role`, `type=access`, `exp`

## Refresh token

- Issues a new access token
- Stored in **HttpOnly cookie** for the client
- **Hashed** value stored in DB (`RefreshToken.token_hash`)

## Auth API surface

```txt
POST /auth/login
POST /auth/refresh
POST /auth/logout
GET  /auth/me
```

## Roles

| Role  | Capabilities                               |
| ----- | ------------------------------------------ |
| admin | Create, update, delete data; manage users  |
| staff | Login; staff pages; read recipe/admin data |

## Dependencies

Implement in `app/dependencies/auth_dependency.py`:

- `get_current_user`
- `require_admin`
- `require_staff_or_admin`

Use `AppError` + `UNAUTHORIZED` / `FORBIDDEN` from `app.constants.status_code` — not `HTTPException`.

## Password hashing

Argon2 via `pwdlib` in `app/core/security.py`:

```python
hash_password(password)
verify_password(password, password_hash)
```
